### 🧭 About Me

I'm a Mechanical Engineering undergrad at **Shri G.S. Institute of Technology and Science, Indore**, working at the intersection of robotics hardware, embedded systems, and embodied AI. My work spans wearable sensing devices, humanoid robot dynamics, ROS 2 navigation stacks, and UAV design.

**🟢 Currently open to full-time roles and internships** in robotics engineering — perception, controls, and robotic hardware. Recently wrapped up my Robotics Engineer internship at XP Robotics, where I built egocentric wearable sensing devices and VLA data pipelines for imitation learning research.

- 🔭 Currently working on **humanoid inverse dynamics** and a **20-DOF smart tactile glove**
- 🌱 Learning: SLAM, robot kinematics, sensor fusion at a deeper level
- 🏆 Samsung Fellowship recipient (ISWDP Cohort 7, selected from 4,700+ applicants)
- 📍 Based in Indore, India
- 💬 Open to relocation/remote — reach out via [LinkedIn](https://www.linkedin.com/in/hansrajgupta07) or email

