### 🚀 Featured Projects

| Project | Description |
|---|---|
| [**Egocentric Devices**](https://github.com/XP-Robotics/EGOCENTRIC_DEVICES) | Wearable device for synchronized visual and inertial data acquisition, using embedded systems for robotics and AI applications |
| [**Humanoid Inverse Dynamics**](https://github.com/Hansrajgupta07/humanoid_inverse_dynamics) | Inverse and multibody dynamics workflow for a 24-DOF bipedal humanoid in MSC Adams, focused on joint torque estimation |
| [**ROS2 Autonomous Navigation**](https://github.com/Hansrajgupta07/ros2_autonomous_navigation) | ROS2-based autonomous mobile robot simulation with SLAM, localization, path planning, and obstacle avoidance on TurtleBot3 in Gazebo |
| [**Stretchable Strain Sensor**](https://github.com/Hansrajgupta07/Stretchable_strain_sensor) | Study on the influence of ambient temperature and humidity on a screen-printed stretchable strain sensing array |
| [**Autonomous Drone**](https://github.com/Hansrajgupta07/autonomous_drone) | UAV engineering project covering path planning, mission execution, payload delivery, and drone control |

